pe":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(´ω`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春ですね。\nなので、春らしい写真を載せます🌸"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKPDK66E3PCRV55JHKM4QM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKPEK9S57Y6C1R34T5T74J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKPFRPHQGFRDP8G9ME7EVV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKPGP9M8ZPERMZPA1KW9VK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満開の桜を見ました。\n春は、あったかくて大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、メンバー1くらいで寒さが苦手なので、冬に比べて春は暮らしやすいです☃️🌸\nそんな暖かい日はお散歩したくなりますね。\nあと、愛犬が一緒にいたら最高だな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝、早起きして愛犬と一緒にお散歩するのが理想の朝です☀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに遅寝遅起になる時があるので、早寝早起きを心がけていきたいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、そう言えば\nそろそろ握手会だ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"化粧水は何を使ってるの?と、握手会でよく聞かれるのですか、HAKUの化粧水と乳液を使っています🙂\n小学生の時くらいから変わってないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井戸自身が俺っさ〜🎶\n↑ずっと頭に残ってる〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15602":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだスマホ\n湯船に落としてしまったんだよね`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂でスマホいじりながら寝ちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってのはよくやるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湯船に落としたのは初めてで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構な時間\n中田と一緒に湯船の中に浸かってたみたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、無傷！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のところ何にも変わらず\n安定にブログ書いてます(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"防水って\nこんなにも防水なんだね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日\n『アニカンRヤンヤン!!』Vol.12\nが発売されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね、さゆにゃん、中田で\n中に入ってる別冊の\n表紙をしてるのでチェックしてね〜＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/12/09/9965560/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ\nやっときづいたんだけど\nこれアメブロと連動してるんだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで何回か\nみなさんが教えてくれてたけど\n理解してなかった(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから\nそっちのコメントも読むね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7167":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま帰国しました(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて行ったけど\n台湾っていいですね(*゜ロ゜)\nふわふわアイスとか小籠包とかお茶とか\nおいしかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/2051810/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ今回は観光目的じゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この度HTC Jが台湾と香港で発売されて\nあのHTC JのCMが台湾や香港でも\n放送される！\nということで\nイベントなどをさせていただきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいです(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text"